        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(feishu): add chunk-idle timeout to inbound media download",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where Feishu inbound media downloads that stall after the Lark SDK returns a stream body (headers/start ok, then no further chunks) would block `saveMessageResourceFeishu` forever via `saveMediaStream`'s unbounded `for await`, so inbound dispatch never produces an agent reply for that attachment.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n- Route every Feishu inbound `saveMediaStream` path through `saveMediaStreamWithIdleTimeout` (production floor 30s), matching Telegram's download idle floor and the WhatsApp/LINE channel pattern.\n- Idle helper lives in `extensions/feishu/src/media-chunk-idle.ts` so the oversized legacy `media.ts` does not grow past the LOC ratchet.\n- On timeout, reject with `FeishuInboundMediaTimeoutError`, call `iterator.return()`, and silence the losing `next()`.\n- Only `saveMediaStreamWithIdleTimeout` is exported (knip); timeout class/helper stay module-private.\n- Does **not** change core `saveMediaStream` / `src/media/store.ts`.\n- Does **not** touch Feishu docx URL reads (`#104663`).\n\nNo new config/env surface.\n\n## User Impact\n\n**Before:** A stalled Feishu message-resource body could hang inbound handling for that attachment indefinitely.\n\n**After:** Idle streams fail closed after 30s with a clear timeout error so the Feishu monitor loop can continue.\n\n## Evidence\n\nHead: `e1f3556024994d5a9f10dd985fc1d4143a9cdc7d`\n\n### Executable negative control + wrap proof\n\n```bash\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/feishu/src/media-chunk-idle.test.ts -- --run --reporter=verbose\n```\n\n```text\n[feishu media idle negative control] outcome=still-pending wait_ms=150 without_idle_wrap=true\n[feishu media idle proof] timed_out=true elapsed_ms=51 chunkTimeoutMs=50 production_ms=30000\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  5 passed (5)\n```\n\n## Real behavior proof\n\nProduction `saveMediaStreamWithIdleTimeout` → real Plugin SDK `saveMediaStream` (no media-store mock) with a stalled AsyncIterable.\n\n```bash\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/feishu/src/media-chunk-idle.proof.test.ts -- --run --reporter=verbose\n```\n\n```text\n[feishu media idle production proof] timed_out=true elapsed_ms=55 real_saveMediaStream=true chunkTimeoutMs=50\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  1 passed (1)\n```\n\n- **Canonical path:** Feishu inbound media → idle wrap → Plugin SDK `saveMediaStream`.\n- **Boundary:** real media store write path; only the stalled source iterator is synthetic.\n- **CI note:** unrelated compact-small tooling flake (when present) is outside this surface.\n\nAI-assisted.\n",
        "branch": "fix/feishu-inbound-media-chunk-idle",
